  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "No Em, you don\u2019t understand, I have to find that key or Karl might
      get into real trouble because of me."
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'Easy there, Ames. You said he lent it to you so you could put that letter
      into that one guys locker, right? Maybe you just accidentally threw it in there
      with the letter? '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "No, I know I locked the door to the guy\u2019s locker rooms afterwards
      so that can\u2019t be. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "Alright, then maybe we could ask around if anyone\u2019s seen it? You
      said it had a green tag attached to it, right?"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 1
    text: "That must be the key I picked up yesterday. So it\u2019s for the boy\u2019s
      locker rooms. "
    videoEventId: 
